Third-party components
----------------------

stb_vorbis (vendor/stb/stb_vorbis.c)
  Ogg Vorbis decoder by Sean Barrett, public domain / MIT (dual license, see the end of the file).
  https://github.com/nothings/stb

Mbed TLS 3.6.7 (downloaded and built by vendor/mbedtls/fetch.sh and build.sh; not stored in this repository)
  Apache License 2.0 OR GNU General Public License v2.0 or later.
  https://github.com/Mbed-TLS/mbedtls

Shannon stream cipher (music/Spot/shannon.c)
  C port of rust-shannon from the librespot project, MIT License.
  https://github.com/librespot-org/librespot

Lucide icons (Resources/lucide-*.png)
  Tab bar and queue icons from Lucide, ISC License.
  https://lucide.dev

Material Icons "music_note" (path used in tools/make_icon.py for the app icon)
  Google, Apache License 2.0.
  https://github.com/google/material-design-icons

Apple root certificates (Resources/roots.pem)
  Public root CA certificates as shipped with macOS, used only to verify TLS connections.

